  'guide.jpgMaker.details':'Input\n• Browse for .notebook files, drag files onto the drop area, or paste files while this tool is focused.\n• Add more than one notebook to preview pages from each file. Use its trash icon to remove one.\n\nPage Navigation\n• Click a page to preview it.\n• Ctrl+click a page to select or deselect it.\n• Shift+click a checkbox to select a range.\n• Use ↑ and ↓ to move between pages.\n\nExport\n• Pages are not selected by default. Choose Export Selected or Export All Pages.\n• JPEG quality defaults to 100%; choose 70%, 80%, 85%, 90%, 95%, or 100%.\n• Each page downloads as a separate JPG. Very large pages are scaled to fit the browser canvas limit.',

