  'guide.timestampMaker.details':'Choosing Assets\n• Open a Master Canvas and click on pencil icon, then select List assets.\n• Use the recording-date filters to narrow the list. Only video assets without a filled timestamp can be updated.\n\nEntering Values\n• Select the assets you want to update, then fill Page and Problem numbers in the matching fields. Blank fields are left unchanged.\n• You can paste tab-separated Page and Problem values into the fields.\n\nApplying Changes\n• Choose Fill timestamp fields and confirm. Each timestamp dialog is saved as it is filled; the Master Canvas itself is not saved.\n• Review the course and save the Master Canvas in LearnCraft when finished.',

