  'guide.learncraft.details':'Why an extension?\n• A web page cannot see your other browser tabs. The extension reads them for this page. It only touches craft.learn.co.th tabs and sends nothing over the internet.\n\nBefore you extract\n• Log in to LearnCraft with your company account and open the course you want to extract.\n\nWhat you get\n• Course type, then every part, section, mission (Eggspace only), subsection and asset with the times LearnCraft shows.\n\nGoogle Sheets\n• Copy table gives one row per asset. Turn Repeat names off to leave repeated names blank.',
