  'guide.golive.details':'Before you start\n• Log in to LearnCraft and open the Master Canvas of the course you want to "Go Live".\n\nWhile it runs\n• Each variant shows Queued, Working, Ready or Needs attention. A step can wait up to 60 seconds for LearnCraft to move on.\n• You may switch to other tabs, but do not click inside the Master or variant tabs yourself.\n• Stop ends the run after the click in progress. Nothing more is clicked.\n\nAfter the run\n• Variants that need attention are listed with the reason. Their tabs stay open so you can check them by hand.\n• Use Copy log to keep a record or to report a problem.',
